  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is a&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;matrix and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
