  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We need to find the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is the order of the matrix and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is a constant.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now we know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence, the required answer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
